      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the proposed MedCLIPSeg framework for text-driven medical image segmentation.\nThe model extends CLIP with vision and language encoders connected via PVL Adapters , which perform confidence-weighted image–text fusion at multiple deep layers. Segmentation and uncertainty maps arise from the mean and entropy of posterior samples, with a soft patch-level contrastive loss.",
